<https://example.org/kg/resource/comment/TEST-1/0> <https://example.org/kg/onto#detail> "# ai-implement-build-up-learnings\n\nFeature: cache TTL configuration\n\nThe build-up phase revealed that the cache TTL needs to be configurable per endpoint. We initially hard-coded 60 seconds but production traffic showed we need per-endpoint control. The fix is a YAML key `cache_ttl_seconds` per route." .
<https://example.org/kg/resource/comment/TEST-1/0> <https://example.org/kg/onto#fix> "# ai-implement-build-up-learnings\n\nFeature: cache TTL configuration\n\nThe build-up phase revealed that the cache TTL needs to be configurable per endpoint. We initially hard-coded 60 seconds but production traffic showed we need per-endpoint control. The fix is a YAML key `cache_ttl_seconds` per route." .
