<https://example.org/kg/resource/comment/TEST-10/0> <https://example.org/kg/onto#detail> "## Summary\n\nThis PR adds the golden snapshot-delta test to the base template. The test ingests the fixture repo and fixture tracker data, runs write_parts into a temp dir, and diffs the line counts against the checked-in golden table.\n\n## Approach\n\nUsed _make_fixture_repo from test_spine.py to create a deterministic git repo. Called _add_issue directly to avoid needing a LINEAR_API_KEY. The --write flag regenerates the golden file deterministically." .
