<https://example.org/kg/resource/comment/TEST-2/0> <https://example.org/kg/onto#detail> "ai-implement-build-down-learnings\n\nThe implementation diverged from the plan at step 3 because the upstream API changed its response schema. Next time, pin the API version in the fixture before the build-down phase begins. This prevented a clean golden test run until we updated the snapshot." .
