<https://example.org/kg/resource/comment/TEST-3/0> <https://example.org/kg/onto#detail> "AI Planning: Sprint scope\n\nWe will implement the snapshot-delta test in three steps. Step 1: create the fixture tracker-data file covering all classifier branches. Step 2: write the test script that ingests fixture and compares to golden. Step 3: run with --write and commit the golden. The risk is non-determinism in commit SHAs but line counts are stable. Mitigation: use a deterministic run ID so the run node IRI is stable across invocations." .
<https://example.org/kg/resource/comment/TEST-3/0> <https://example.org/kg/onto#fix> "AI Planning: Sprint scope\n\nWe will implement the snapshot-delta test in three steps. Step 1: create the fixture tracker-data file covering all classifier branches. Step 2: write the test script that ingests fixture and compares to golden. Step 3: run with --write and commit the golden. The risk is non-determinism in commit SHAs but line counts are stable. Mitigation: use a deterministic run ID so " .
